<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasBaseUnit> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This property relates a system of units to a base unit defined within the system. The base units of a system are used to define the derived units of the system by expressing the derived units as products of the base units raised to a rational power."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
