<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDerivedUnit> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This property relates a system of units to a unit of measure that is defined within the system in terms of the base units for the system. That is, the derived unit is defined as a product of the base units for the system raised to some rational power."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
