<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/baseUSCustomaryUnitDimensions> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "\"qudt:baseUSCustomaryUnitDimensions\" is a string datatype property expressing the dimensions of a unit, or quantity, as a vector over the base units in the US Customary System."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
