<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A <i>Quantity Value</i> expresses the magnitude and kind of a quantity and is given by the product of a numerical value <code>n</code> and a unit of measure <code>U</code>. The number multiplying the unit is referred to as the numerical value of the quantity expressed in that unit. Refer to <a href=\"http://physics.nist.gov/Pubs/SP811/sec07.html\">NIST SP 811 section 7</a> for more on quantity values."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
