<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/EndianType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/EnumeratedValue> .
<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/EndianType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Endian Type" .
